<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">Sakachep: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">65001 -Unicode (UTTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">Ephesi Mingei</para>
  <para style="toc1">EPHESI Mingei kôma Paul Lekhamuthuon</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ephesi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Eph</para>
  <para style="mt1">EPHESI</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mingei Kôma Paul Lekhamuthuon</para>
  <para style="imt1">Chongmaruoi</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Ephesi mingei kôma Paul lekhamuthuon</char> hin amotontaka a minlang nuom chu “Pathien'n a mintuo invân le pilchunga a neinun sinngei nâm hih minchuna Khrista roineina nuoia aom let rang ani” (1:10). Jisua Khrista leh munkhat an ninna jâra miriemngei inruolna ranga hi neinun mintuona lien omtie min om theina rangin Pathien mingei kôma ngênna ani sa.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Ephesi</char> miziek hih aphutna tieng chu a miziekpu hin inruolna hih chonglupuia mangin Pa Pathien'n a mingei a thang tie ngei, ngâidam an ni tie ngei, Nâipasal Jisua Khrista jâra an nunsienangei renga mojôk an ni tie ngei le Pathien chongkhâm hah Ratha Inthiengin khâmna a pêk tie ngei a misîr ani. A inikna chu Khrista leh munkhat an nina hah an ringnun han an minlang theina ranga aporepungei a ngênna ani.</para>
  <para style="ip">Khrista leh inzoma Pathien mingei munkhat an ninna minlangna rangin chongmintêk tamtak mang ani. Koiindang hih takpum angin ania, Khrista chu a lu ani, aninônchu in angin ania, Khrista hah akila lung ania; aninônchu Khrista hah a lômpa angin ania, male koiindang hah a lômnu angin ani. Khrista taka Pathien lungkhamna mindonnân a mulung atôn ok sikin hi lekhamuthuon chong hih ânsâng ok ani. Khrista lungkhamna, inbôlnapêk, ngâidamna, moroina, le inthiengna vâr taka han neinuntin mu thei ani.</para>
  <para style="is1">Asûnga chongtângpuingei</para>
  <para style="io1">Chongmaruoi <char style="ior"><ref loc="EPH 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Khrista le Koiindang <char style="ior"><ref loc="EPH 1:3-3:21">1:3—3:21</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Khrista taka Ringna Thar <char style="ior"><ref loc="EPH 4:1-6:20">4:1—6:20</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Chongkhârna <char style="ior"><ref loc="EPH 6:21-24">6:21-24</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1"/>
  <para style="s">Chibaimûkna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 18:19-21">Sin 18:19-21</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19:1">19:1</ref></char>
    </note> Pathien nuomlama Khrista Jisua a tîrton Paul han,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:1">Ephesi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ephesi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ti hih miziek senkhata chu dôn makngei</char></note> taka om Pathien mingei, Khrista Jisua leh munkhata an ringnun taksônoma mang ngei.<verse eid="EPH 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2"/>Pathien ei Pa le Pumapa Jisua Khrista'n moroina le inngêina nangni pêk rese.<verse eid="EPH 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khrista taka ratha satvurnangei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3"/>Pathien le ei Pumapa Jisua Khrista Pa kôm ei râisânchong mintung ei tih u! Khrista leh ên jômna sika han invânrama ratha satvurnangei nâm mi vura. <verse eid="EPH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4"/>Rammuol insieng mân renga, Pathien'n Khrista jâra a makunga inthieng le minchâinaboi nirangin mi lei thangsai ani zoi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:4">A lungkhamna sikin <verse eid="EPH 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5"/>Pathien'n<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:4-5: </char><char style="fv">4</char><char style="fq">a makunga...</char><char style="fp" closed="false">A lungkhamna sikin; </char><char style="fv">5</char> <char style="fq" closed="false">Pathien'n</char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">amakungah, male lungkhamna taka om rangin. Pathienin</char></note> Jisua Khrista jâra a nâingei mi minchang rangin alei mintuosai ani, maha a râisânna le a neinunkhîn ani. <verse eid="EPH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6"/>A lungkhamna roiinpuitak hah, a nâipasal taka han neinun manboipêk mi pêk sikin Pathien chu minpâk ei tih u! <verse eid="EPH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7"/>Khrista inbôlna thisen sikin<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:7: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">thisen sikin; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Khrista thina inbôlnapêk sika hah.</char></note> ei sietnangei ngâidamin, jôkin ei om zoi. Pathien moroina roiinpui tie hih,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:14">Kol 1:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8"/>minkhîna lientak mi pêk hi!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:8">A vârna le a rietheina ngei nâmin <verse eid="EPH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9"/>Pathien neinunkhîn ngei hah zoiin aoma, a lungdo inthup hah zoi ranga a lei khâm chu Khrista taka han min zoi rangin mi min riet zoi. <verse eid="EPH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10"/>Ma a lungdo hah azora diktaka Pathien'n neinunsinngei nâm, invân le pilchunga omngei nâm minchunin Khrista han alutak ani rang. <verse eid="EPH 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11"/>Neinunngei murdi hih Pathien lungdo le a jêklam angtaka tho ania; hanchu Pathien'n aphutnataka a mintuo lam angtakin Khrista taka a mingei nirangin mi thang zoi ani. <verse eid="EPH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12"/>Tho masikin eini Khrista lei sabei masa ngei hin Pathien roiinpuina minpâk ei tih u. <verse eid="EPH 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13"/>Sanminringna Thurchi Sa, chongtak nin riet lehan Pathien mingei nin hongni zoi. Jisua Khrista nin iema, male Pathien'n Ratha Inthieng a khâm lehan pumanina mohôr nangni nam ani. <verse eid="EPH 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14"/>Pathien'n a mingei a khâm pe ngei hah la man ei tih, ti hah ratha khâmna ania, Pathien mingei murdi zalên pharna pêk atih, ti khom mi min riet sa ani. Tho a roiinpuina minpâk ei tih u!<verse eid="EPH 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paul chubaithona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15"/>Masikin keima khom, Pumapa Jisua nin taksôn le Pathien mingei nin lungkhamna ti ki riet renga chu, <verse eid="EPH 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16"/>Pathien kôm râisânchong ki mintung hih mong khâi mu-ung. Chubai ko thôna khom nangni ki riettit ngâi. <verse eid="EPH 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17"/>Male ei Pumapa Jisua Khrista Pathien, Pa roiinpuitak han, ama nin rietna rangin, Ratha vârna le inlârna nangni pêk rangin ke ngên ani. <verse eid="EPH 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18"/>Ama vâr nin mu theina rangin nin mulungrîlngei ân-onga, nangni a koina taka sabeina aom ngei, a mi inthieng ngei ranga a khâm satvurnangei kamâmruoi tamtak ngei le, <verse eid="EPH 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19"/>keini a iemngei kâra sinthotheina lien tie ngei hah nin riet theina rangin ke ngên ngâi ani. Hi râtna, kin chunga sin atho tit hih râtna inthieng <verse eid="EPH 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20"/>Khrista thina renga inthoinôka invânrama a chang tienga ânsung lâia a mang nanâk hah ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Lap 110:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21"/>Khrista chu invâna roijêkpungei, rachamneipungei, sinthotheinangei, le pumangei; hi rammuol le rammuol a lahong om ranga rachamneipungei chunga riming ânchungtak a la dôn rang ani. <verse eid="EPH 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22"/>Pathien'n neinunngei murdi hih Khrista ke nuoia a dara, ma neinunngei murdi hah Pumapa ânchungtak han koiindang kôm a pêk zoi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:6">Lap 8:6</ref></char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22,23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:18">Kol 1:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23"/>Koiindang chu Khrista takpum ani, mun nâma neinun murdi mikhippharpu kipna hah ani.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:23: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mun nâma neinun murdi mikhippharpu kipna hah; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Pathien renga kippharna asipin adônpu nanâk hah.</char></note><verse eid="EPH 1:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2"/>
  <para style="s">Thina renga ringna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1"/>Zora vunsai han chu chongdonloi le sietnangei sikin rathatieng nin thi ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1-5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:13">Kol 2:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2"/>Mâlâia hanchu rammuola lampui saloingei nin jûia; munronga ratha sinthotheinangei, rachamneipungei chong nin don ania, atûna Pathien chongdonloingei lâia sinthotit ratha hih ani. <verse eid="EPH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3"/>Adiktakin eini khom ei rêngin anni angin ei om ani, ei taksa ngâituina dungjûiin ei oma, ei takpum le ei mulungrîl lungdongei ei sin ngâi ani. Eini khom midangngei angin eini sikin, Pathien ningthikna tuong rang piela inzir ei leini. <verse eid="EPH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4"/>Aniatachu, Pathien moroina hah atamin a lungkhamna hah alien ani, <verse eid="EPH 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5"/>ei chongdonloina sika rathatieng athi eini lâitak khomin ama'n Khrista leh mi minring zoi ani. Pathien moroina han kêng sanminring nin ni zoi. <verse eid="EPH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6"/>Khrista Jisua leh ei inzomna sika han invânrama ama leh roijêk rangin ama leh mi kaithoi zoia. <verse eid="EPH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7"/>Mangei murdi hah a lei thôna abi chu, zora lahong rang ngeia Khrista Jisua han mi lungkhamna le mi moroina alieka lien tie hah ei chunga a minlang theina ranga ani. <verse eid="EPH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8"/>Pathien moroina sikin nin taksônna han sanminring kêng nin ni. Nangni renga suok nimaka, Pathien neinunpêk ani. <verse eid="EPH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9"/>Sinthona sika khom nimak, masikin tute insong thei mak ngei. <verse eid="EPH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10"/>Pathien kutsuokngei eini, Khrista Jisua han sin asa tho ranga mi sin ani, ma sin sa hah ei tho ranga a lei minsûk piel kêng ani.<verse eid="EPH 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khrista taka pumkhatnina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11"/>Nangni, ânzir renga Jentailngei, Juda “Sertan” (maha miriemngei an takpuma an tho, a rokôkna ani) ki ni inti ngâi ngeiin “Sertanloingei” nangni an ti ngâi hah, zora vunsaia nin nina hah riettit roi. <verse eid="EPH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12"/>Ma lâia han chu Khrista leh nin tei ani, Ramdangmingei nin nia, Pathien mi thangngei nimak cheia. Pathien'n a mingei kôma a chonginkhâm chongtung han rangtum dôn mak chei, male sabeina boi le Pathien boiin hi rammuola hin nin om ani. <verse eid="EPH 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13"/>Aniatachu, atûn chu Khrista Jisua han, nangni ala taka om ngâi ngei hah Khrista thisen<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Khrista thisen sikin; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Khrista thina inbôlna sika.</char></note> sikin nangni hong minnâi zoia. <verse eid="EPH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14"/>Khrista'n, Judangei le Jentailngei hih mi inkhata sinin inngêina mi pêk zoi. An insenna le râl an inchangna banglâi hah ama takpum lelên a misim pe ngei zoi. <verse eid="EPH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15"/>Ama han Judangei balam leh chongpêkngei le jûiruongei murdi a minboia, ama'n inik ngei hah miriem thar, inkhata sinin, inngêina a sin ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:14">Kol 2:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16"/>Khrosa a thina sika han, Khrista'n râl an inchangna hah a minboia, ma khros sika han jât inik ngei hah molopin takpum inkhata sinin Pathien tieng a hong mikhîr nôk ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:20">Kol 1:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17"/>Masikin, Khrista a juonga mingei murdi kôma inngêina Thurchi Sa hih a misîr ani, nangni Jentail Pathien leh inkârzana omngei kôm khom, Juda ama nâikik ngei kôm khom.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 57:19">Isa 57:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18"/>Khrista jârin ei rêngin Judangei le Jentailngei Ratha inkhatin Pa kôm ei lût thei ani.<verse eid="EPH 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19"/>Masikin nangni Jentailngei khom ramdangmingei le khuolmi ni khâi mak cheia, atûn chu Pathien mingei le ramkhatmi le Pathien insûngmingei kêng nin ni zoi. <verse eid="EPH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20"/>Nangni khom tîrtonngei le dêipungei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:20: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">tîrtonngei le dêipungei lungphûm; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">lungphûm hah, tîrtonngei le dêipungei an ni.</char></note> lungphûm chunga sinminding nin ni, akila lung kâmomtak chu Khrista Jisua lelê hah ani. <verse eid="EPH 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21"/>Ama hah a in pumpui sûra Pathien biekin inthieng minsôna Pumapa kôma minlang ngâipu ani. <verse eid="EPH 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22"/>Ama leh inzomin nangni khom midangngei leh Ratha taka, Pathien omna mun ranga sinminding nin ni.<verse eid="EPH 2:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3"/>
  <para style="s">Jentailngei ranga Paul Sintho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1"/>Masikin keima Paul hin, nangni Jentailngei rang sika Khrista Jisua taka intângmi hin Pathien kôma chubai ko tho ngâi ani. <verse eid="EPH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2"/>Nin satna ranga sintho rangin Pathien'n a moroina mi minrâk hah lei riet ngêt nin tih zoi. <verse eid="EPH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3"/>Pathien'n a lungdo inthup hah a phuonga, keima mi minriet tie hah. (Ma roi hih abongkikin ki mizieka, <verse eid="EPH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4"/>ma ki miziek hah nin porea anînchu Khrista chong inthup ki riet tie hah riet nin tih.)<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4-6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:26-27">Kol 1:26-27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5"/>Zora lei vunsaia han chu hi chong inthup hih miriemngei lei ril ni ngâi maka; nikhomrese, atûn chu Pathien'n a tîrton inthiengngei le a dêipu inthiengngei kôma Ratha Inthiengin a minlâr zoi. <verse eid="EPH 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6"/>Chong inthup chu mahih ani, Thurchisa sikin Judangei, Pathien satvur an changna han Jentailngei khom an changdelsa, takpum inkhata mi an nia, Jisua Khrista taka Pathien chonginkhâm ha munkhatin an chang thei ani. <verse eid="EPH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7"/>A sinthotheina ranak sintit jâra mi pêk, Pathien manboipêk satak han thurchisa tîrlâmin mi sin ani.<verse eid="EPH 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8"/>Keima hih Pathien mingei nâm lâia achîntak nêka achîn uol ki ni, hankhoma Pathien'n sintum satak mi pêk, Jentailngei kôma Khrista neina suisuok theiloi Thurchi Sa misîr rangin, <verse eid="EPH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9"/>male Pathien mintuo inthup kâmnânga om rangin mi nâm kôm min mu ranga sin ania. Pathien, neinunngei murdi sinpu han, kum leivunsai ngeia chong inthup inrûk a dara, <verse eid="EPH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10"/>ma anghan atûnlâia hin, koiindang sikin, vântîrton roijêkpungei le invânrama sinthotheinangei le a vârna dadang ngei murdi an inchu theina rangin. <verse eid="EPH 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11"/>Kumtuonga alei mintuo dungjûiin Pathien'n ei Pumapa Jisua Khrista jârin thang a min suo zoi. <verse eid="EPH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12"/>Khrista ei inzompuina sik le ama ei taksôn sikin hâitak le ngamtakin Pathien kôm ei se thei zoi ani. <verse eid="EPH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13"/>Masikin nangni sika intak ku tuongna sika hin nin jâminzal loina rangin nangni ki ngên ani, mangei hah nin satna rang inzie ani.<verse eid="EPH 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khrista lungkhamna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14"/>Hingei sika hin Pa makunga khûk kên bil ngâi, <verse eid="EPH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15"/>Pa, invân le pilchunga insûngkuo murdi'n an riming diktak an manna hah. <verse eid="EPH 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16"/>Ama Ratha jâra nin sûngrîl tieng râtna nin man theina ranga a roiinpuina rochon renga sinthotheina nangni a pêk theina rangin Pathien kôm ko zong ngâi, <verse eid="EPH 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17"/>male, Khrista hah taksônna sika nin mulungrîla aom theina rang le lungkhamna han ruzung mathâka lungphûm nin nei thei rangin ku chubai sa ngâia, <verse eid="EPH 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18"/>masikin, nangni, Pathien mingei nâm lehan Khrista lungkhamna inzar tie ngei, asei tie ngei, ânsâng le ânthûk tie ngei riettheina ratha nin dôn theina rangin. <verse eid="EPH 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19"/>Nangni minriet mikhip riei thei nino khomrese, a lungkhamna hah riet thei ungla Pathien nina atakin sipmat roi.<verse eid="EPH 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20"/>A kôma a sinthotheina ranak einia a sintitpu han, ei zong phâkloi le ei mindon phâkloi a tho theia: <verse eid="EPH 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21"/>zoratina Pathien kôm, koiindanga le Khrista Jisua han a roiinpuina chu tuonsôt tuonsôtin om tit reseh! Amen.<verse eid="EPH 3:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4"/>
  <para style="s">Inpumkhatna takpum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1"/>Hanchu, keima Pumapa sintho sika intângmi hin: Pathien'n nangni a koi lâia nangni a dar lam angtaka om rangin nangni ke ngên ani. <verse eid="EPH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2"/>Khotiklâi khom nunnêmna, rangâiinchîna le tuongtheina ngei dôn tit ngâi roi, nin lungkhamna hah tuongdiernân inkhat le inkhat chunga minlang roi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:12-13">Kol 3:12-13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3"/>Inngêina han inpumkhatna nangni akhitlomna ngei sika Ratha nangni a pêk inpumna hah dôn tit rangin nin theidôr pûtrît roi. <verse eid="EPH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4"/>Pathien'n nangni a koina taka sabeina inkhat ani anghan takpum inkhat le Ratha inkhat mamang aom. <verse eid="EPH 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5"/>Pumapa inkhat, taksônna inkhat, baptisma inkhat aoma; <verse eid="EPH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6"/>mitinngei Pathien le Pa inkhat aoma, ama hah neinun murdi Pumapa ania, neinun murdi chunga sin a thoa, neinun murdi chunga aom ani.<verse eid="EPH 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7"/>Khrista'n ei rangtum mi pêk lamtakin ei sika neinun manboipêk satak ei chang ani. <verse eid="EPH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8"/>Pathien lekhabu'n,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 68:18">Lap 68:18</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">“Chungtieng insângtaka a kal lâihan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">suok intângngei tamtak a tuonga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">Miriemngei kôm neinunpêkngei a pêk,” ati anghan.<verse eid="EPH 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9"/>“Chungtieng a kal” ti hih khoimo aomzie? Pilchung<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:9: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">pilchung innuoitaka; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">mun innuoina taka, pilchung lelê ha. </char></note> innuoitaka hin a juong chum bak tina ani. <verse eid="EPH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10"/>Masikin, a juong chumpu nanâk hah pil le invân murdia aom let theina rangin invân chunga le invân pênah a se nôk ani. <verse eid="EPH 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11"/>“Miriemngei kôma neinunpêk a pêkpu” hah ama ania, mi senkhat chu tîrtonin a phuna, senkhat chu dêipu'n a phuna, senkhat chu Thurchisa misîrpu'n a phuna, senkhat chu koiindang enkolpu'n a phuna, senkhat chu mi minchupu'n a phun ani. <verse eid="EPH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12"/>Khrista takpum sinmindingna rangin Pathien mingei murdi Khristien sinthona taka an inchel theina rangin maha a tho ani. <verse eid="EPH 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13"/>Male Pathien Nâipasal ei rietna le ei taksônna lama han ei rêngin ma inkhatnina han ei hong intûp rang ani; mitungsuo nîng ei ta, Khrista ulien nina insângtak hah phâk ei tih zoi. <verse eid="EPH 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14"/>Hanchu miriem milaknangei, an milak mang sika midangngei minvâi ngâi ngei, minchuna dikloi sika tuilien insôn ranak le sêm inmang anga nâipang nikhâi no ih. <verse eid="EPH 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15"/>Manêkin, ratha lungkhamna chongtak misîrin Khrista ei lu tieng lamtina hong insôn ei tih u. <verse eid="EPH 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16"/>Ama enkolna nuoia takpuma abâkngei murdi minsûk khomin rolotin sin atho chit anghan, takpumpui chu a sûr minding ani; Masikin abâk chitin sin an tho rang lamtakin an tho inchu takpumpui hah lungkhamna sikin insônin ândingsuok ngâi ani. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:19">Kol 2:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khrista taka ringna thar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17"/>Hanchu, mahih Pumapa rimingin nangni ki minriet; sonongngei angin om khâi no roi, ha ngei mindonna ha chu asenaboi ania, <verse eid="EPH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18"/>an mulungrîlngei khom ijînga om ani. An sêt sik le an mulungrîl inngar sika han Pathien pêk ringna han rangtum dôn makngei. <verse eid="EPH 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19"/>Inzak rietnangei murdi an minmanga, hurna le neinun innim murdi an nuom dôra tho rangin an inpêk zoi. <verse eid="EPH 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20"/>Khrista roi nin inchu ha chu ma anghan nimak. <verse eid="EPH 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21"/>Ama roi nin riet zoia, ama nûkjûipu ngei anghan Jisua chongtaka aom hah minchu nin ni zoia. <verse eid="EPH 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22"/>Masikin nin mi nina muruoa, milak ôina saloia, nin lei om lam muruo asietsai hah nûksong ta roi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:9">Kol 3:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23"/>Nin mulungrîlngei le nin mulungbôkngei sin mintharin aom ngêt rang ani, <verse eid="EPH 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24"/>male mi nina thar, Pathien angna dôna sin ringna dik minlang le ânthienga han invo ngêt roi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26">Aph 1:26</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:10">Kol 3:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25"/>Hanchu milak om khâi nonia, mitinin a iempuipu kôma chongtak ril an tih zoi, Khrista takpuma mingei eini chit sikin.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 8:16">Zak 8:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26"/>Nin taksi khomin ma nin taksina han nunsie tieng nangni tuonglût no senla, sûntuonin taksi pumin om no roi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 4:4">Lap 4:4</ref> (LXX)</char></note> <verse eid="EPH 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27"/>Diabol hah zorânchum pêk no roi. <verse eid="EPH 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28"/>Inru ngâipu han inru tho khâi no senla, ama rang le inriêngngei a san theina rangin sin asa hah tho ta rese. <verse eid="EPH 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29"/>Mi siet thei chong mang no ungla, nin chong rangâi ngeiin satna an man theina rangin akâmom chong mi sinminding ngâi le an nâng a pêk ngâi moroina chong vai hah mang roi. <verse eid="EPH 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30"/>Pathien Ratha Inthieng hah min ngûi no roi; asikchu Ratha hah Pathien nangni mojôk rang Nikhuoa ama ta nin nina sînthona ani. <verse eid="EPH 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31"/>Mulungkhana, ngalna, taksina, êrona, inmumâkna ngei murdi hah mâk ngêt ta roi. <verse eid="EPH 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32"/>Manêkin, lungkham inlômin le mulungbôk minmun ungla, Pathien'n Khrista sikin nangni ngâidam angin inkhat le inkhat in ngâidam inlôm roi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:13">Kol 3:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 4:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5"/>
  <para style="s">Avâr taka om</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1"/>Pathien nâi moroitakngei nin ni sikin ama phuo rangin nin pût ngêt rang ani. <verse eid="EPH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2"/>Khrista'n mi lungkhama, eini rangin a ringna a pêka, inbôlna neinunpêk anga mirimhoi Pathien'n a râisân anghan, nin ringna hah lungkhamnân jêk ngêt rese.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:18">Jôk 29:18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 40:6">Lap 40:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3"/>Pathien mingei nin ni zoi sikin, nin lâia inditnasaloi ngei, inthiengloina ngei aninônchu inruôkna ngei, nin bâia nin ril luo hih adikloi ani. <verse eid="EPH 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4"/>Bâingal ngei, chongkâmboi ngei, tusiem porinche ngei khom nin mang rangin inhoi mak; ha ngei ril nêkin Pathien kôm râisânchongril roi. <verse eid="EPH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5"/>Tutên hurindit song le inthiengloi le inruôkngei (inruôk hih mirmil biek ani) murdi'n, Khrista le Pathien Rêngrama rangtum man noni ngei ti nin riet minthâr sikin.<verse eid="EPH 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6"/>Tutên chongkâmboi leh nangni huong no rese ngei; ma neinunngei sikin kêng Pathien taksina hah ama chongdonloipungei chunga ajuongtung rang ani. <verse eid="EPH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7"/>Masikin ma anga mingei lehan ite inzomkhômna dôn rangin tho no roi. <verse eid="EPH 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8"/>Nangni nanâkin ijînga lei inmangin nin om ngâia, hannirese Pumapa mingei nin hongni zoia, masikin avâra om ngâi mingei anghan nin om ngêt rang, <verse eid="EPH 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9"/>satnangei, diknangei le chongtak jâttin mara tamtak musuok hih avâr<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:9: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">avâr; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ei ti hih miziek senkhata chu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ratha </char><char style="ft" closed="false">an ti ani.</char></note> chu ani. <verse eid="EPH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10"/>Pumapa râisânna ngâi hah imo ani riet rangin pût roi. <verse eid="EPH 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11"/>Mingei an sin ngâi kâmnângloi neinunngei hah ite tho no roi, ijîng ta neinunngei hah. Manêkin avârna hongtuong pai ngei roi. <verse eid="EPH 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12"/>(Inrûka an tho ngâi neinunngei chungroi hih chu amisîr khom inzakpui aom sabak tatak ani.) <verse eid="EPH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13"/>Male neinunngei murdi hi avâra hong tuongin aomin chu, an nina diktak hah ânthârin ânlang ngâia; <verse eid="EPH 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14"/>i-ih neinun khom ânthârlaka inlanga omngei ngân chu avâr ani sikin. Ma sika han kêng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">“Nangma a in meng inla,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:14">thina renga inthoi roh,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">hanchu, Khrista'n nu chunga juong êlminvâr atih,” a ti hah.<verse eid="EPH 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15"/>Masikin mi inmôlngei angin om loiin, mivârngei anga omin, nin om lama singthei roi. <verse eid="EPH 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16"/>Nikhuongei hih asa khâi loi sikin, zorânchum nin dôn ngei hah mang mindik ta roi. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:5">Kol 4:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17"/>Masikin moh no ungla, Pumapa'n nin sin ranga a nuomngei hah riet rangin pût ta roi. <verse eid="EPH 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18"/>Ju inrûiin om no roi, nangni vai kêng nangni asiet rang; manêkin Ratha'n sip roi. <verse eid="EPH 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19"/>Lapuingei chongbâingei, minpâkna lângei, male la inthiengngei leh inrokôk ungla; minpâkna lângei lapuingei lehan nin mulungrîlngeia Pumapa kôm minpâkna lâtho roi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19-20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:16-17">Kol 3:16-17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20"/>Neinunnâm chunga ei Pumapa Jisua Khrista rimingin, zoratin Pa Pathien kôm ngêt han râisânchongril roi.<verse eid="EPH 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lômnungei le lômpangei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21"/>Khrista taka nin inthieng sikin inkhat le inkhat inpêklût inlôm roi. <verse eid="EPH 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22"/>Lômnungei, Pumapa kôm nin inpêklût anghan nin lômpangei kôm inpêklût roi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:18">Kol 3:18</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:1">1 Pet 3:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23"/>Khrista chu ama takpum, koiindang sanminringpu ania, koiindang chunga racham a nei anghan pasal khomin a lômnu chunga racham a nei ani. <verse eid="EPH 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24"/>Koiindangin Khrista chunga ânpêklût anghan lômnungei khomin an lômpangei chunga an inpêkrip rang ani.<verse eid="EPH 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25"/>Lômpangei, nin lômnungei lungkham roi. Khrista'n koiindang a lungkham sikin a ringna a pêk anghan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:19">Kol 3:19</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:7">1 Pet 3:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26"/>Koiindang hah tuia rusûk minsâia, ama chong sika han Pathien kôm a pêk theina ranga maha a tho ani. <verse eid="EPH 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27"/>Innimna koploi, demnaboi, minchâinaboi, kôknaboi le jûrnaboi le chukloina reng omloia, ama kôm nanâka koiindang hah a pêk theina rangin. <verse eid="EPH 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28"/>Ma anghan, pasalngei khomin an takpum angtakin an lômnungei an lungkham ngêt rang ani. A lômnu lungkham kai chu ama ânlungkham ani. <verse eid="EPH 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29"/>(Tutên ama takpum heng ngâi mak, a vâiin a donsûi ngâi; Khrista'n koiindang a donsûia a vâi ngâi anghan, <verse eid="EPH 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30"/>a takpum abâkngei eini sikin) <verse eid="EPH 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31"/>Pathien lekhabu'n, “Masikin pasalin a nû le a pa mâk a ta, a lômnu leh inpumkhat an ta, inik hah inkhat chang an tih,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Aph 2:24</ref></char></note> ati anghan. <verse eid="EPH 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32"/>Ma Pathien Lekhabua han chongtak inthup inthûk minlanga om aom, maha keiman chu Khrista leh a koiindang a misîrnân ki rietthei. <verse eid="EPH 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33"/>Aniatachu nangni tieng khom mang thei ania; pasal nâmin anni angin, an lômnungei an lungkham rang ani, lômnungei nâm khomin an pasalngei mirit an tho rang ani.<verse eid="EPH 5:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6"/>
  <para style="s">Nulepangei le nâingei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1"/>Nâipangngei, Pumapa taka han nin nulepangei chongdon roi, maha nin Khristien sintum tak,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:1: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Miziek senkhat ngeia chu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">maha nin Khristien sintum tak</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ti hih ommak ani.</char></note> le neinun dik tak ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:20">Kol 3:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2"/>“Nin nû le pa ngei mirit tho roi,” ti hih chongpêk masataka lei khâm ani:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2,3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Jôk 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Bal 5:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3"/>“Masikin ninta rangin sâng a ta, pilchunga nin dam sôt atih.”<verse eid="EPH 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4"/>Nulepangei, nin nâingei ningthik rang lamin tho pe no ungla. Manêkin, Khristien rilna le minchuna han kairuoi ngei roi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:21">Kol 3:21</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Suokngei le pumangei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5"/>Suokngei, Khrista sintho anghan ichi le innîk pumin mulungrîl diktakin taksa tienga nin pungei chongdon roi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5-8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:22-25">Kol 3:22-25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6"/>Nangni an modômna rangin, an mitmu kârin vai sin no ungla, Khrista suokngei anghan Pathien'n a nuomna hah nin mulungrîl murdi'n jôm roi. <verse eid="EPH 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7"/>Miriem sin vai niloia, Pumapa sintho asa anghan nin sin hah suok angin tâihieiin sin roi. <verse eid="EPH 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8"/>Mitinin suok khom suok niloi khom sin asa an tho lam angtakin Pumapa'n râisânman pêk atih, ti hih riettit roi.<verse eid="EPH 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9"/>Suok pumangei, nin suokngei tieng khom ha ang nanâk han tho ungla, misi ngei khâi no roi. Nangni le nin suokngei puma hah, invâna aoma, mi murdi chunga ân-angsâra roijêkpu ta nin ni, ti riettit roi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Bal 10:17</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:25">Kol 3:25</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:1">4:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pathien râlrovo pumpui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10"/>Anûktaka chu, Pumapa taka sinthotheina lien lehan nin ranak minding roi. <verse eid="EPH 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11"/>Diabol huongvâr saloingei nin doi zoi theina rangin, Pathien'n nangni a pêk râlrovo murdia han invo roi. <verse eid="EPH 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12"/>Ei inbuonpui ngei hih taksa le thisen nimak ngeia, invânrama ranak, ratha saloingei, roijêkpungei, rachamneipungei, hi ijîng chunga rammuola ratha saloi ranakngei hi an ni. <verse eid="EPH 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13"/>Masikin atûn Pathien râlrovo invo ta roi. Hanchu, nikhuo saloi ahong tungin, râlngei ranak song hah nin khap zoia, among dêna nin insuolpui ngei suonûk khomin lânding thei tit nin tih.<verse eid="EPH 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14"/>Masikin, indingdet ungla, chongtak hah kongkhit angin nin konga khit ungla, dikna hah rôpphoa mangin,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:5">Isa 11:5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 59:17">59:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15"/>inngêina Thurchi Sa misîr ranga inthokna hah kekok angin mang roi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:7">Isa 52:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16"/>Zoratin taksônna hah pho angin mang ungla, mahan Saloi Inkhatpa renga thal kâp meichuong murdi ngei hah that thei nin tih. <verse eid="EPH 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17"/>Sanminringna hah thîr tapor angin lâk ungla, Ratha'n nangni a pêk Pathien chong hah khandai angin lâk roi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:17">Isa 59:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18"/>Ha ngei murdi hah chubaithoa Pathien kôm ngên pumin tho roi. Khotiklâi khomin, Ratha'n nangni aruoi lam takin chubaitho ngâi roi. Masika han mâk tet loiin inning tit ungla, zoratin Pathien mingei ta rangin chubaitho sa ngâi roi. <verse eid="EPH 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19"/>Hâitakin thurchi ki misîra, thurchisa taka inthup hah ki min riet theina ranga phuong ranga kên ding tika, Pathien chong mi pêkna rangin keima rang khomin chubai ni tho pe sa ngâi roi. <verse eid="EPH 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20"/>Atûn intângina om khom inlang, ha thurchisa palâi hah ki ni. Masikin thurchisa misîrna lama ka hâi rang lam angtaka ka hâi theina rangin chubai mi tho pe sa ngâi roi.<verse eid="EPH 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Azoina chibai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21"/>Ku chungroi nin riet theina rangin Tychicus, lâibung moroitak le Pumapa sinthona taka tîrlâm taksônomtakpu han, ku thurchi anrêngin nangni lei ril a tih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">Sin 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:12">2 Tim 4:12</ref></char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:21,22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:7-8">Kol 4:7-8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22"/>Masik taka hin ama hah ko hongtîr ani, kin rênga kin chungroi nangni ril rang le nangni mohôk rangin.<verse eid="EPH 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23"/>Khristien sûngsuokngei nâm chunga, Pa Pathien le Pumapa Jisua Khrista'n taksônna lehan, inngêina le lungkhamna, nangni pêk rese. <verse eid="EPH 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24"/>Lungkhamna thiloi leh ei Pumapa Jisua Khrista lungkham titpu ngei murdi kôm han Pathien moroina hah om rese.<verse eid="EPH 6:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6"/>
</usx>
